Subject: [EXPERIMENT] ASoC: q6apm: identify the FullIO graph owner

Adapt the integrated backend token and graph lookup from the pinned FullIO
reference. Do not run backend-owned graph commands on the integrated FE.
Until the protected FE sequence is implemented, return an error rather than
falling back to the ordinary backend graph.

